## Casper's tag.hbs header card. Expects $headerTitle, $headerDescription (may be empty) and $headerCount.
<section class="post-card post-card-large">
  <div class="post-card-content">
    <div class="post-card-content-link">
      <header class="post-card-header">
        <h1 class="post-card-title">$headerTitle</h1>
      </header>
      <div class="post-card-excerpt">
        #if($utils.isNotEmpty($headerDescription))
        $headerDescription
        #elseif($headerCount == 1)
        A collection of 1 post
        #else
        A collection of $headerCount posts
        #end
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
